@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@accessToken = paste-a-local-access-token-here

### Minimal public readiness check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Discover the endpoints exposed by the active profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### See which controller method handles each route (local profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/mappings
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Inspect Spring-created beans (local profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/beans
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List available metric names (local profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Inspect one JVM metric (local profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/jvm.threads.live
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
